<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Thursday that on December 27 it will redeem the entire $40 million principal amount of its 6.48 percent fixed-rate debentures due June 26, 1998.</p>
<p>The series has cusip number 3134A0U91.</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the issues in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on December 26.</p>
</text>
